# Not Dead After All on a mutated creature (Cubwarden put under Ornithopter, CR 702.140c): when it dies, both its cards return
# (CR 730.3c), and a Wicked Role is made for each (the ruling of 2023-09-01), both in one instruction, so one event (CR 101.4,
# 603.2c). Kambal's "whenever one or more tokens you control enter, each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life" triggers
# once for Cubwarden's two Cats and once for the two Roles: Bot2 at 18, Bot1 at 22.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Kambal, Profiteering Mayor
Not Dead After All
Cubwarden
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kambal, Profiteering Mayor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cubwarden.Cast(Ornithopter; Ability: Mutate)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Modes(2)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Life = 19
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Not Dead After All.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Attached = Wicked > Ornithopter; Wicked > Cubwarden
Bot1.Battlefield.Cubwarden.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Life = 22
